le=\"white-space:nowrap\">work-soc-category-score<a name=\"prenudge-workability-work-soc-category-score\"> </a></td><td>Work-SoC category score</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">work-soc-comprehensibility<a name=\"prenudge-workability-work-soc-comprehensibility\"> </a></td><td>Work-SoC comprehensibility score</td><td>Calculated Work-SoC comprehensibility score. Formula: (Item 1 + Item 3 + Item 6 + Item 9) / 4.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">work-soc-manageability<a name=\"prenudge-workability-work-soc-manageability\"> </a></td><td>Work-SoC manageability score</td><td>Calculated Work-SoC manageability score. Formula: (Item 4 + Item 7) / 2.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">work-soc-meaningfulness<a name=\"prenudge-workability-work-soc-meaningfulness\"> </a></td><td>Work-SoC meaningfulness score</td><td>Calculated Work-SoC meaningfulness score. Formula: (Item 2 + Item 5 + Item 8) / 3.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">wai-questionnaire<a name=\"prenudge-workability-wai-questionnaire\"> </a></td><td>Work Ability Index short questionnaire</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">wai-current-work-ability<a name=\"prenudge-workability-wai-current-work-ability\"> </a></td><td>Current work ability compared with lifetime best</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">wai-physical-demands-work-ability<a name=\"prenudge-workability-wai-physical-demands-work-ability\"> </a></td><td>Current work ability in relation to physical work demands</td><td/></tr></table></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
